{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","$id":"gate-record.schema.json","title":"GateRecord（人工關卡簽章紀錄）","description":"Policy Engine 驗證的是本紀錄的簽章（金鑰只以金鑰登錄為準，D11）與 artifact.sha256，而不是 checkpoint 內容。G0a／G0b 是對委任設定／ROE 的離線驗章紀錄：outcome 為 VERIFIED／VERIFY_FAILED／EXPIRED，approvers＝文件簽署人，簽章在被驗證的文件上，本紀錄 signatures 可以是空陣列。其他關卡每位核准者一份簽章。","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,
"properties":{
"gate_record_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^GR-[0-9A-Za-z-]+$"},
"gate":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/gate"},
"engagement_id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/engagement_id"},
"run_id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/run_id"},
"round":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"G1／G3／G4 的重擬輪次（G1 最多 3 輪）；其他關卡為 1"},
"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"kind":{"enum":["engagement","roe","invariants","disputed_clusters","threat_model","test_plan","s2_job","budget"]},"sha256":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256"}},"required":["kind","sha256"],"description":"被核准的產物；多項產物（G2 叢集、G3 威脅、G4 測試計畫）用 set digest＝sha256(JCS(依 id 排序的 [{id, sha256}]))"},
"job_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"只有 G5：被核准的 job"},
"g4_gate_record_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","pattern":"^GR-[0-9A-Za-z-]+$"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"v0.5（BL-04）：只有 G5：本 run 中最後一份對該 job 的測試案例做出 accept 決定的 G4 紀錄；G5 核准者與該 G4 的核准者不能重疊（E-G5-G4）。其他關卡為 null"},
"initiator":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_id"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"發起執行、認領（initiator_claim）或核准 G4 的人；不得是自動化帳號；G5 核准者不得是發起者"},
"approvers":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_ref"},"minItems":1,"description":"每個關卡要求的角色見 docs/02 §1.3"},
"outcome":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/gate_outcome"},
"decisions":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{
  "item_id":{"type":"string"},
  "item_sha256":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"逐項核准時該項的 approval hash（G2 叢集、G3 威脅、G4 測試案例）"},
  "decision":{"enum":["accept","reject","needs_info","over_cap"],"description":"v0.5（審查 2026-10-25 M-4）：over_cap 只用在 G3，由 Gate Service 在呈現前寫入：該種子威脅超出 gate_queues.g3_max_items，沒有人審查。核准者的簽章證明「這些項目沒有被審查」，不是替駁回背書；over_cap 依規則視同駁回（不產生測試案例、R13 加註、威脅 review.status REJECTED），理由固定為「超出 G3 上限」。高風險（有 attack tree）與 impact high 的威脅不受上限，不能是 over_cap"},
  "risk_override":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"likelihood":{"enum":["high","medium","low"]},"impact":{"enum":["high","medium","low"]}},"required":["likelihood","impact"]},{"type":"null"}],"description":"G3 調整風險；調降時 note 必填"},
  "note":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"G3 駁回種子威脅或調降風險時必填（docs/02 §5）"},
  "carried_from":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"run_id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/run_id"},"gate_record_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^GR-[0-9A-Za-z-]+$"},"item_sha256":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256"}},"required":["run_id","gate_record_id","item_sha256"]},{"type":"null"}],"description":"v0.5（BL-21）：只有 G1／G3 的 accept：這一項的內容沒有變，沿用祖先 run 的核准（E-GATE-CARRY）。本紀錄仍由本 run 的核准者簽章；沿用只省下重審內容。null＝本 run 重新審查"}},
  "required":["item_id","item_sha256","decision","risk_override","note","carried_from"]},"minItems":1},
"gb":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{
  "phase":{"enum":["W","B","run_total"]},
  "choice":{"enum":["extend","stop_phase","abort"],"description":"extend→APPROVED；stop_phase→REJECTED；abort→APPROVED 且 run 轉 ABORTED"},
  "new_caps":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/budget_caps"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"extend 時必填"},
  "tradeoffs":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"例如降低 V、移除校準權重最低的家族；寫入報告"}},
  "required":["phase","choice","new_caps","tradeoffs"]},{"type":"null"}],"description":"只有 GB"},
"verification":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{
  "document_ref":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256"},
  "key_registry_version":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},
  "signer_results":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"person_id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_id"},"key_fingerprint":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/fingerprint"},"ok":{"type":"boolean"},"reason":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["person_id","key_fingerprint","ok","reason"]},"minItems":1}},
  "required":["document_ref","key_registry_version","signer_results"]},{"type":"null"}],"description":"只有 G0a／G0b：離線驗章結果"},
"opened_at":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/datetime"},
"timestamp":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/datetime","description":"決定（簽署）時間"},
"signatures":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/signature"}}},
"required":["gate_record_id","gate","engagement_id","run_id","round","artifact","job_id","initiator","approvers","outcome","decisions","gb","verification","opened_at","timestamp","signatures"]}
